- !<Text/78c53f49-49b3-4dbb-8092-5d28a8c5709f>
  PrefabRemaps:
    []
  Name: Text
  Enabled: true
  RenderOrder: 11
  StretchMode: Stretch
  VerticalAlignment: Center
  HorizontalAlignment: Left
  MeshShadowMode: None
  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    WebSocket Examples: live WebSocket connections
    from Specs to your own server.
    
    Text Echo sends a text and a binary message
    and logs the echoed replies.
    IMU Visualization rotates a cube from
    streamed motion-sensor data.
    
    Both need your own server address (see the
    package README); until then they show
    "Setup required".
